title: "An 8-regular graph of girth 7 on 768 vertices: Lean 4 proof of the cage bound n(8,7) <= 768"
abstract: "Lean 4 proof that there is an 8-regular graph of girth 7 on 768 vertices, so the cage number n(8,7) is at most 768."
